{"2928640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Countryball: World 1930", "steam_appid": 2928640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Countryball: World 1930 is a turn-based grand strategy game about leading a country through uncertain history. Manage territory and resources, move armies, negotiate with rivals, and decide when diplomacy should give way to war—all with the expressive countryball cast at the center.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURN-BASED GRAND STRATEGY</h2><br>Plan one move at a time, then live with the consequences. Expand carefully, defend key borders, and adapt when alliances or fronts shift.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/6acb4b901769879ebeeb914d25560018.poster.avif?t=1785150348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/6acb4b901769879ebeeb914d25560018.webm?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/6acb4b901769879ebeeb914d25560018.mp4?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR NATION</h2><br>Develop territories, balance resources, and strengthen production so your campaigns can last longer than the first battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/1cc905487bdd47674d318b0b0aed0b6e.poster.avif?t=1785150348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/1cc905487bdd47674d318b0b0aed0b6e.webm?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/1cc905487bdd47674d318b0b0aed0b6e.mp4?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIPLOMACY, FACTIONS, AND WAR</h2><br>Negotiate treaties, form alliances, join factions, or challenge the powers around you. Recruit infantry, tanks, and aircraft, then commit them where they matter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERALS, SOLDIERS, AND EQUIPMENT</h2><br>Hire generals, train specialized soldiers, and equip useful items as your countryball grows through the campaign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN COUNTRYBALL</h2><br>Draw a custom flag and bring your own countryball into the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/eb43a5ca66647af016784b59938bd315.poster.avif?t=1785150348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/eb43a5ca66647af016784b59938bd315.webm?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/eb43a5ca66647af016784b59938bd315.mp4?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMPAIGNS ACROSS DIFFERENT ERAS</h2><br>Play several history-inspired scenarios, each with a different balance of borders, rivals, and strategic problems.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAINING AND SIDE ACTIVITIES</h2><br>Use minigames and side activities to train your countryball between larger decisions.", "about_the_game": "Countryball: World 1930 is a turn-based grand strategy game about leading a country through uncertain history. Manage territory and resources, move armies, negotiate with rivals, and decide when diplomacy should give way to war—all with the expressive countryball cast at the center.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURN-BASED GRAND STRATEGY</h2><br>Plan one move at a time, then live with the consequences. Expand carefully, defend key borders, and adapt when alliances or fronts shift.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/6acb4b901769879ebeeb914d25560018.poster.avif?t=1785150348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/6acb4b901769879ebeeb914d25560018.webm?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/6acb4b901769879ebeeb914d25560018.mp4?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR NATION</h2><br>Develop territories, balance resources, and strengthen production so your campaigns can last longer than the first battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/1cc905487bdd47674d318b0b0aed0b6e.poster.avif?t=1785150348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/1cc905487bdd47674d318b0b0aed0b6e.webm?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/1cc905487bdd47674d318b0b0aed0b6e.mp4?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIPLOMACY, FACTIONS, AND WAR</h2><br>Negotiate treaties, form alliances, join factions, or challenge the powers around you. Recruit infantry, tanks, and aircraft, then commit them where they matter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERALS, SOLDIERS, AND EQUIPMENT</h2><br>Hire generals, train specialized soldiers, and equip useful items as your countryball grows through the campaign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN COUNTRYBALL</h2><br>Draw a custom flag and bring your own countryball into the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/eb43a5ca66647af016784b59938bd315.poster.avif?t=1785150348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/eb43a5ca66647af016784b59938bd315.webm?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/extras/eb43a5ca66647af016784b59938bd315.mp4?t=1785150348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMPAIGNS ACROSS DIFFERENT ERAS</h2><br>Play several history-inspired scenarios, each with a different balance of borders, rivals, and strategic problems.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAINING AND SIDE ACTIVITIES</h2><br>Use minigames and side activities to train your countryball between larger decisions.", "short_description": "Lead your countryball to glory in a WWII-inspired turn-based grand strategy game. Build your nation, manage resources, recruit armies and generals, forge alliances, and conquer territory across multiple historical campaigns.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/12b870f6b411fa32ae31e689d2d386202a408dc5/header.jpg?t=1785150348", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/44b76a3e974984540b602f8d9be195e4bafbdf0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785150348", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/44b76a3e974984540b602f8d9be195e4bafbdf0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785150348", "website": "https://www.shngames.co